        {
          "line": 309,
          "text": "Pin the DAPR sidecar image to a specific version (e.g., `1.18.0`) \u2014 avoid mutable tags like `latest` (see [CI/CD Image Tagging](#cicd-image-tagging))."
        },
        {
          "line": 414,
          "text": "The `deploy-staging.yml` workflow uses `staging-latest` mutable tags for staging deployments. For production, use immutable tags \u2014 either a SemVer tag (e.g., `v1.2.3`) or a SHA digest (e.g., `@sha256:abc123...`). Mutable tags like `latest` or `staging-latest` mean rollbacks may silently pick up a different image than the one originally deployed."
        }
