        {
          "line": 420,
          "text": "> **Why `startupProbe` with `failureThreshold: 30`?** DAPR sidecar initialization (connecting to placement service, loading components, establishing mTLS) can take 10\u201330 seconds on cold starts. Without a startup probe, the liveness probe may kill the pod before the sidecar is ready."
        },
        {
          "line": 475,
          "text": "> **Warning:** `DAPR_TRUST_DOMAIN` and `DAPR_NAMESPACE` in the `accesscontrol*.yaml` files **must** be explicitly set. The fallback defaults (`hexalith.io` and `hexalith`) are reference values only \u2014 `hexalith.io` is a real domain and not safe for production use without intentional configuration. See [Adapt DAPR Components for Kubernetes Secrets](#adapt-dapr-components-for-kubernetes-secrets) for how to provide these values."
        },
        {
          "line": 571,
